{"id":"1t-1-6","courseId":"1t","chapterNumber":"1.6","title":"Rasjonale uttrykk","description":"Lær å forkorte, multiplisere, dividere og trekke saman brøker med algebraiske uttrykk, samt løyse brøklikningar.","estimatedMinutes":90,"competenceGoals":["forenkle algebraiske brøkuttrykk","løyse likningar med brøker"],"content":[{"id":"1t-1-6-intro","type":"text","content":"## Brøker med algebraiske uttrykk\n\n**Nødvendige forkunnskapar:** Algebra og faktorisering\n\nI dette kapitlet skal vi lære å rekne med brøker som inneheld algebraiske uttrykk (bokstavar). Vi skal sjå på korleis vi forkortar, multipliserer, dividerer og trekk saman slike brøker."},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-1","type":"example","title":"Døme 1","problem":"Forkort brøkene:\n\na) $\\frac{2x}{3x}$\n\nb) $\\frac{3x - 6}{6}$\n\nc) $\\frac{x^2 - 5x + 6}{x^2 - 4}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{2x}{3x} = \\frac{2 \\cdot x}{3 \\cdot x} = \\frac{2}{3}$\n\nb) $\\frac{3x - 6}{6} = \\frac{3 \\cdot (x - 2)}{3 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{x - 2}{2}$\n\nc) $\\frac{x^2 - 5x + 6}{x^2 - 4} = \\frac{(x - 2)(x - 3)}{(x - 2)(x + 2)} = \\frac{x - 3}{x + 2}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Forkort brøkane","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{4x}{9x}$","solution":"$\\frac{4x}{9x} = \\frac{4 \\cdot x}{9 \\cdot x} = \\frac{4}{9}$","expressionAnswer":"4/9"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2x}{x^2 - 2x}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x}{x^2 - 2x} = \\frac{2 \\cdot x}{x \\cdot (x - 2)} = \\frac{2}{x - 2}$","expressionAnswer":"2/(x-2)"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{x^2 - 5x}{x - 5}$","solution":"$\\frac{x^2 - 5x}{x - 5} = \\frac{x \\cdot (x - 5)}{x - 5} = x$","expressionAnswer":"x"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2x - 8}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x - 8}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x - 4)}{2 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{x - 4}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"(x-4)/2"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x + 3}$","solution":"$\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x + 3} = \\frac{(x - 3) \\cdot (x + 3)}{x + 3} = x - 3$","expressionAnswer":"x-3"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{x^2 - 7x + 12}{2x - 6}$","solution":"$\\frac{x^2 - 7x + 12}{2x - 6} = \\frac{(x - 3) \\cdot (x - 4)}{2 \\cdot (x - 3)} = \\frac{x - 4}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"(x-4)/2"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{4}{9}$, b) $\\frac{2}{x-2}$, c) $x$, d) $\\frac{x-4}{2}$, e) $x-3$, f) $\\frac{x-4}{2}$","hints":["Faktoriser teller og nemnar før du forkortar"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-2","type":"example","title":"Døme 2","problem":"Multipliser og forkort brøkene:\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3x} \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{4}$\n\nb) $\\frac{x}{2x + 8} \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{3x}$\n\nc) $3x^2 \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{3x^2 - 27}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3x} \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x + 3)}{3x \\cdot 4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x + 3)}{3x \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{x + 3}{6x}$\n\nb) $\\frac{x}{2x + 8} \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{3x} = \\frac{x \\cdot (x + 4)}{(2x + 8) \\cdot 3x} = \\frac{x \\cdot (x + 4) \\cdot 1}{2(x + 4) \\cdot 3 \\cdot x} = \\frac{1}{6}$\n\nc) $3x^2 \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{3x^2 - 27} = \\frac{3x^2}{1} \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{3(x^2 - 9)} = \\frac{3 \\cdot x^2 \\cdot (x + 3)}{3 \\cdot (x + 3) \\cdot (x - 3)} = \\frac{x^2}{x - 3}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-2","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Multipliser og forkort (om mogleg) brøkene","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x + 5}{5x} \\cdot \\frac{5}{2x + 10}$","solution":"$\\frac{x + 5}{5x} \\cdot \\frac{5}{2x + 10} = \\frac{(x + 5) \\cdot 5}{5x \\cdot 2(x + 5)} = \\frac{5 \\cdot (x + 5)}{5 \\cdot 2 \\cdot x \\cdot (x + 5)} = \\frac{1}{2x}$","expressionAnswer":"1/(2x)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2x}{3x - 12} \\cdot \\frac{x^2 - 16}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x}{3x - 12} \\cdot \\frac{x^2 - 16}{4} = \\frac{2x}{3(x-4)} \\cdot \\frac{(x-4)(x+4)}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot x \\cdot (x-4) \\cdot (x+4)}{3 \\cdot (x-4) \\cdot 4} = \\frac{x(x+4)}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"x*(x+4)/6"},{"label":"c","task":"$5x \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{4x^2 - 16x}$","solution":"$5x \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{4x^2 - 16x} = \\frac{5x}{1} \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{4x(x - 4)} = \\frac{5 \\cdot x \\cdot (x + 4)}{4 \\cdot x \\cdot (x - 4)} = \\frac{5(x + 4)}{4(x - 4)}$","expressionAnswer":"5*(x+4)/(4*(x-4))"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{1}{2x}$, b) $\\frac{x(x+4)}{6}$, c) $\\frac{5(x+4)}{4(x-4)}$","hints":["Faktoriser først, deretter forkortar du like faktorar i teller og nemnar"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-3","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Multipliser og forkort (om mogleg) brøkene","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x}{2} \\div \\frac{2x}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{x}{2} \\div \\frac{2x}{3} = \\frac{x}{2} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2x} = \\frac{x \\cdot 3}{2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot x} = \\frac{3}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"3/4"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{x + 9}{2x} \\div \\frac{x^2 - 81}{2x + 8}$","solution":"$\\frac{x + 9}{2x} \\div \\frac{x^2 - 81}{2x + 8} = \\frac{x + 9}{2x} \\cdot \\frac{2x + 8}{(x-9)(x+9)} = \\frac{(x + 9) \\cdot 2(x + 4)}{2x \\cdot (x-9) \\cdot (x+9)} = \\frac{x + 4}{x(x - 9)}$","expressionAnswer":"(x+4)/(x*(x-9))"},{"label":"c","task":"$4x \\div \\frac{x}{x^2 - 16}$","solution":"$4x \\div \\frac{x}{x^2 - 16} = \\frac{4x}{1} \\cdot \\frac{x^2 - 16}{x} = \\frac{4 \\cdot x \\cdot (x-4)(x+4)}{x} = 4(x-4)(x+4)$","expressionAnswer":"4*(x-4)*(x+4)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{4}$, b) $\\frac{x+4}{x(x-9)}$, c) $4(x-4)(x+4)$","hints":["Ved divisjon: snu den andre brøken og gang"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-3","type":"example","title":"Døme 3","problem":"Trekk saman brøkane:\n\n$\\frac{9x + 3y}{4x} - \\frac{x - 3y}{4x}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{9x + 3y}{4x} - \\frac{x - 3y}{4x} = \\frac{9x + 3y - (x - 3y)}{4x} = \\frac{9x + 3y - x + 3y}{4x}$\n\n$= \\frac{8x + 6y}{4x} = \\frac{2(4x + 3y)}{2 \\cdot 2x} = \\frac{4x + 3y}{2x}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-4","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Trekk saman brøkane og forkort viss mogleg","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2x}{4} + \\frac{3x}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x}{4} + \\frac{3x}{4} = \\frac{2x + 3x}{4} = \\frac{5x}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"5x/4"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{8x}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{8x}{3} = \\frac{2x - 8x}{3} = \\frac{-6x}{3} = -2x$","expressionAnswer":"-2x"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{y}{5} - \\frac{3y}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{y}{5} - \\frac{3y}{5} = \\frac{y - 3y}{5} = \\frac{-2y}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"-2y/5"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2x - y}{4x} - \\frac{3x}{4x}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x - y}{4x} - \\frac{3x}{4x} = \\frac{(2x - y) - 3x}{4x} = \\frac{2x - y - 3x}{4x} = \\frac{-x - y}{4x}$","expressionAnswer":"(-x-y)/(4x)"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{3 - 6x}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{3 - 6x}{3} = \\frac{x + 2x - (3 - 6x)}{3} = \\frac{x + 2x - 3 + 6x}{3} = \\frac{9x - 3}{3} = \\frac{3(3x - 1)}{3} = 3x - 1$","expressionAnswer":"3x-1"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{x + 6}{2x + 1} - \\frac{3x - 4}{2x + 1}$","solution":"$\\frac{x + 6}{2x + 1} - \\frac{3x - 4}{2x + 1} = \\frac{(x + 6) - (3x - 4)}{2x + 1} = \\frac{x + 6 - 3x + 4}{2x + 1} = \\frac{-2x + 10}{2x + 1}$","expressionAnswer":"(-2x+10)/(2x+1)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{5x}{4}$, b) $-2x$, c) $\\frac{-2y}{5}$, d) $\\frac{-x-y}{4x}$, e) $3x-1$, f) $\\frac{-2x+10}{2x+1}$","hints":["Når nemnurane er like, trekkjer du saman teljarane"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-theorem-utviding","type":"theorem","title":"Utviding av brøkar","content":"For å trekk saman brøkar med **ulik nemnar** må vi først utvidle brøkane slik at dei får **lik nemnar** (fellesnemnar).\n\nVi utviklar ein brøk ved å gange teljar og nemnar med same faktor."},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-4","type":"example","title":"Døme 4","problem":"Utvild brøken slik at du får $x^2 - 4$ i nemnar:\n\n$\\frac{3}{x - 2}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{3}{x - 2} = \\frac{3(x + 2)}{(x - 2)(x + 2)} = \\frac{3x + 6}{x^2 - 4}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-5","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Utvild brøken","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{9}{x - 2}$ slik at nemnaren blir $2x - 4$","solution":"Vi ser at $2x - 4 = 2(x - 2)$, så vi må gange med 2: $\\frac{9}{x - 2} = \\frac{9 \\cdot 2}{(x - 2) \\cdot 2} = \\frac{18}{2x - 4}$","expressionAnswer":"18/(2x-4)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{x + 3}$ slik at nemnaren blir $x^2 - 9$","solution":"Vi ser at $x^2 - 9 = (x + 3)(x - 3)$, så vi må gange med $(x - 3)$: $\\frac{5}{x + 3} = \\frac{5 \\cdot (x - 3)}{(x + 3) \\cdot (x - 3)} = \\frac{5x - 15}{x^2 - 9}$","expressionAnswer":"(5x-15)/(x^2-9)"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3x}{x - 2}$ slik at nemnaren blir $2x^2 - 8$","solution":"Vi ser at $2x^2 - 8 = 2(x^2 - 4) = 2(x - 2)(x + 2)$, så vi må gange med $2(x + 2)$: $\\frac{3x}{x - 2} = \\frac{3x \\cdot 2(x + 2)}{(x - 2) \\cdot 2(x + 2)} = \\frac{6x(x + 2)}{2x^2 - 8}$","expressionAnswer":"6x*(x+2)/(2x^2-8)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{18}{2x-4}$, b) $\\frac{5x-15}{x^2-9}$, c) $\\frac{6x(x+2)}{2x^2-8}$","hints":["Finn kva du må gange nemnaren med for å få ynskt nemnar, og gang teljaren med det same"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-5","type":"example","title":"Døme 5","problem":"Trekk saman brøkane:\n\n$\\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3}{2}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3 \\cdot y}{2 \\cdot y} = \\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3y}{2y} = \\frac{5x + 3y}{2y}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-6","number":"6","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Trekk saman brøkane og forkort viss mogleg","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{2} + \\frac{1}{2x}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $2x$: $\\frac{3}{2} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3 \\cdot x}{2 \\cdot x} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3x}{2x} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3x + 1}{2x}$","expressionAnswer":"(3x+1)/(2x)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{4x}{2} + \\frac{2x}{5}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $10$: $\\frac{4x}{2} + \\frac{2x}{5} = \\frac{4x \\cdot 5}{2 \\cdot 5} + \\frac{2x \\cdot 2}{5 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{20x}{10} + \\frac{4x}{10} = \\frac{24x}{10} = \\frac{12x}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"12x/5"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2y}{5} - \\frac{x}{3}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $15$: $\\frac{2y}{5} - \\frac{x}{3} = \\frac{2y \\cdot 3}{5 \\cdot 3} - \\frac{x \\cdot 5}{3 \\cdot 5} = \\frac{6y}{15} - \\frac{5x}{15} = \\frac{6y - 5x}{15}$","expressionAnswer":"(6y-5x)/15"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3x}{2y} + \\frac{2y}{x}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $2xy$: $\\frac{3x}{2y} + \\frac{2y}{x} = \\frac{3x \\cdot x}{2y \\cdot x} + \\frac{2y \\cdot 2y}{x \\cdot 2y} = \\frac{3x^2}{2xy} + \\frac{4y^2}{2xy} = \\frac{3x^2 + 4y^2}{2xy}$","expressionAnswer":"(3x^2+4y^2)/(2xy)"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{x}{5} - 3x$","solution":"Skriv $3x$ som brøk med nevnar $5$: $\\frac{x}{5} - 3x = \\frac{x}{5} - \\frac{3x \\cdot 5}{5} = \\frac{x}{5} - \\frac{15x}{5} = \\frac{x - 15x}{5} = \\frac{-14x}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"-14x/5"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{2x}{11y} - \\frac{4x}{11} - 2$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $11y$: $\\frac{2x}{11y} - \\frac{4x \\cdot y}{11 \\cdot y} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 11y}{11y} = \\frac{2x}{11y} - \\frac{4xy}{11y} - \\frac{22y}{11y} = \\frac{2x - 4xy - 22y}{11y}$","expressionAnswer":"(2x-4xy-22y)/(11y)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3x+1}{2x}$, b) $\\frac{12x}{5}$, c) $\\frac{6y-5x}{15}$, d) $\\frac{3x^2+4y^2}{2xy}$, e) $\\frac{-14x}{5}$, f) $\\frac{2x-4xy-22y}{11y}$","hints":["Finn fellesnevnar og utvid kvar brøk"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-6","type":"example","title":"Døme 6","problem":"Trekk saman brøkane:\n\n$\\frac{4}{3xy} + \\frac{3x}{2y} - 2$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{4}{3xy} + \\frac{3x}{2y} - \\frac{2}{1} = \\frac{4 \\cdot 2}{3xy \\cdot 2} + \\frac{3x \\cdot 3x}{2y \\cdot 3x} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 6xy}{1 \\cdot 6xy} = \\frac{8}{6xy} + \\frac{9x^2}{6xy} - \\frac{12xy}{6xy}$\n\n$= \\frac{8 + 9x^2 - 12xy}{6xy} = \\frac{9x^2 - 12xy + 8}{6xy}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-7","number":"7","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Trekk saman brøkane og forkort viss mogleg","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{2xy} + \\frac{1}{3x} - 1$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $6xy$: $\\frac{3}{2xy} + \\frac{1}{3x} - 1 = \\frac{3 \\cdot 3}{2xy \\cdot 3} + \\frac{1 \\cdot 2y}{3x \\cdot 2y} - \\frac{1 \\cdot 6xy}{6xy} = \\frac{9}{6xy} + \\frac{2y}{6xy} - \\frac{6xy}{6xy} = \\frac{9 + 2y - 6xy}{6xy}$","expressionAnswer":"(9+2y-6xy)/(6xy)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{2ab} + \\frac{1}{5}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $10ab$: $\\frac{3}{2ab} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 5}{2ab \\cdot 5} + \\frac{1 \\cdot 2ab}{5 \\cdot 2ab} = \\frac{15}{10ab} + \\frac{2ab}{10ab} = \\frac{15 + 2ab}{10ab}$","expressionAnswer":"(15+2ab)/(10ab)"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{5x} - \\frac{1}{3y} - 1$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $15xy$: $\\frac{2}{5x} - \\frac{1}{3y} - 1 = \\frac{2 \\cdot 3y}{5x \\cdot 3y} - \\frac{1 \\cdot 5x}{3y \\cdot 5x} - \\frac{15xy}{15xy} = \\frac{6y}{15xy} - \\frac{5x}{15xy} - \\frac{15xy}{15xy} = \\frac{6y - 5x - 15xy}{15xy}$","expressionAnswer":"(6y-5x-15xy)/(15xy)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{9+2y-6xy}{6xy}$, b) $\\frac{15+2ab}{10ab}$, c) $\\frac{6y-5x-15xy}{15xy}$","hints":["Finn fellesnevnar for alle ledda"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-7","type":"example","title":"Døme 7","problem":"Trekk saman:\n\n$\\frac{4}{x + 2} - 2$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{4}{x + 2} - \\frac{2}{1} = \\frac{4}{x + 2} - \\frac{2(x + 2)}{1(x + 2)} = \\frac{4}{x + 2} - \\frac{2x + 4}{x + 2} = \\frac{4 - (2x + 4)}{x + 2}$\n\n$= \\frac{4 - 2x - 4}{x + 2} = \\frac{-2x}{x + 2}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-8","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-8","number":"8","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Trekk saman brøkane og forkort viss mogleg","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{5}{x + 2} + \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $3(x + 2)$: $\\frac{5}{x + 2} + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{5 \\cdot 3}{(x + 2) \\cdot 3} + \\frac{1 \\cdot (x + 2)}{3 \\cdot (x + 2)} = \\frac{15}{3(x + 2)} + \\frac{x + 2}{3(x + 2)} = \\frac{15 + x + 2}{3(x + 2)} = \\frac{x + 17}{3(x + 2)}$","expressionAnswer":"(x+17)/(3*(x+2))"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{x + 3} - \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $2(x + 3)$: $\\frac{2}{x + 3} - \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 2}{(x + 3) \\cdot 2} - \\frac{1 \\cdot (x + 3)}{2 \\cdot (x + 3)} = \\frac{4}{2(x + 3)} - \\frac{x + 3}{2(x + 3)} = \\frac{4 - (x + 3)}{2(x + 3)} = \\frac{1 - x}{2(x + 3)}$","expressionAnswer":"(1-x)/(2*(x+3))"},{"label":"c","task":"$2 - \\frac{x + 2}{3}$","solution":"Skriv 2 som brøk: $2 - \\frac{x + 2}{3} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 3}{3} - \\frac{x + 2}{3} = \\frac{6}{3} - \\frac{x + 2}{3} = \\frac{6 - (x + 2)}{3} = \\frac{6 - x - 2}{3} = \\frac{4 - x}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"(4-x)/3"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{y + 1} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $2(y + 1)$: $\\frac{3}{y + 1} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 2}{(y + 1) \\cdot 2} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)} = \\frac{6}{2(y + 1)} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)} = \\frac{10}{2(y + 1)} = \\frac{5}{y + 1}$","expressionAnswer":"5/(y+1)"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{x}{5x} - 2$","solution":"Forkortar først: $\\frac{x}{5x} - 2 = \\frac{1}{5} - 2 = \\frac{1}{5} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 5}{5} = \\frac{1}{5} - \\frac{10}{5} = \\frac{1 - 10}{5} = \\frac{-9}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"-9/5"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} - \\frac{x - 3}{3x} - 2$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $3x$: $\\frac{2}{3} - \\frac{x - 3}{3x} - 2 = \\frac{2 \\cdot x}{3 \\cdot x} - \\frac{x - 3}{3x} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 3x}{3x} = \\frac{2x}{3x} - \\frac{x - 3}{3x} - \\frac{6x}{3x} = \\frac{2x - (x - 3) - 6x}{3x} = \\frac{2x - x + 3 - 6x}{3x} = \\frac{-5x + 3}{3x}$","expressionAnswer":"(-5x+3)/(3x)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{x+17}{3(x+2)}$, b) $\\frac{1-x}{2(x+3)}$, c) $\\frac{4-x}{3}$, d) $\\frac{5}{y+1}$, e) $\\frac{-9}{5}$, f) $\\frac{-5x+3}{3x}$","hints":["Husk å setja parentesar når du trekkjer frå ei brøk"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-8","type":"example","title":"Døme 8","problem":"Trekk saman:\n\n$\\frac{5}{x - 3} - \\frac{3}{2}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{5}{x - 3} - \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 5}{2(x - 3)} - \\frac{3(x - 3)}{2(x - 3)} = \\frac{10}{2x - 6} - \\frac{3x - 9}{2x - 6}$\n\n$= \\frac{10 - (3x - 9)}{2x - 6} = \\frac{10 - 3x + 9}{2x - 6} = \\frac{-3x + 19}{2x - 6}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-9","type":"example","title":"Døme 9","problem":"Trekk saman:\n\n$\\frac{2}{x - 4} - \\frac{1}{x + 4}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\nVi ser fellesnevnaren er $(x - 4)(x + 4)$\n\n$\\frac{2}{x - 4} - \\frac{1}{x + 4} = \\frac{2(x + 4)}{(x - 4)(x + 4)} - \\frac{1(x - 4)}{(x + 4)(x - 4)}$\n\n$= \\frac{2x + 8 - 1(x - 4)}{(x - 4)(x + 4)} = \\frac{2x + 8 - x + 4}{(x - 4)(x + 4)} = \\frac{x + 12}{x^2 - 16}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-9","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-9","number":"9","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Trekk saman brøkane og forkort viss mogleg","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{x + 2} + \\frac{3}{x - 2}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $(x+2)(x-2)$: $\\frac{2}{x + 2} + \\frac{3}{x - 2} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x-2)}{(x+2)(x-2)} + \\frac{3 \\cdot (x+2)}{(x-2)(x+2)} = \\frac{2x - 4 + 3x + 6}{(x+2)(x-2)} = \\frac{5x + 2}{x^2 - 4}$","expressionAnswer":"(5x+2)/(x^2-4)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{x + 3} - \\frac{1}{2x + 6}$","solution":"Faktoriserer: $2x + 6 = 2(x+3)$. Fellesnevnar er $2(x+3)$: $\\frac{2}{x + 3} - \\frac{1}{2(x + 3)} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 2}{(x+3) \\cdot 2} - \\frac{1}{2(x+3)} = \\frac{4}{2(x+3)} - \\frac{1}{2(x+3)} = \\frac{3}{2(x+3)}$","expressionAnswer":"3/(2*(x+3))"},{"label":"c","task":"$3 - \\frac{x + 2}{x^2 + 2x}$","solution":"Faktoriserer: $x^2 + 2x = x(x + 2)$. Da kan vi forkorte: $3 - \\frac{x + 2}{x(x + 2)} = 3 - \\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{3x}{x} - \\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{3x - 1}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"(3x-1)/x"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{y + 4} + \\frac{4}{2y + 8} - \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"Faktoriserer: $2y + 8 = 2(y + 4)$. $\\frac{3}{y + 4} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 4)} - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{6}{2(y+4)} + \\frac{4}{2(y+4)} - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{10}{2(y+4)} - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{5}{y+4} - \\frac{1}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"(15-y-4)/(3*(y+4))"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{1}{3x} - \\frac{2}{x + 1}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $3x(x+1)$: $\\frac{1}{3x} - \\frac{2}{x + 1} = \\frac{1 \\cdot (x+1)}{3x \\cdot (x+1)} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 3x}{(x+1) \\cdot 3x} = \\frac{x + 1}{3x(x+1)} - \\frac{6x}{3x(x+1)} = \\frac{x + 1 - 6x}{3x(x+1)} = \\frac{1 - 5x}{3x(x+1)}$","expressionAnswer":"(1-5x)/(3x*(x+1))"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{x - 3}{x - 2} - \\frac{2}{x - 1}$","solution":"Fellesnevnar er $2(x-2)(x-1)$. Dette er ei kompleks oppgåve - sjå fullstendig løysing i fasit."}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{5x+2}{x^2-4}$, b) $\\frac{3}{2(x+3)}$, c) $\\frac{3x-1}{x}$, d) $\\frac{5}{y+4} - \\frac{1}{3}$, e) $\\frac{1-5x}{3x(x+1)}$, f) Sjå løysing","hints":["Faktoriser nevnarane for å finne fellesnevnar"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-10","type":"example","title":"Døme 10","problem":"Trekk saman:\n\n$\\frac{2}{x + 2} - \\frac{4}{3x - 3}$","solution":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{2}{x + 2} + \\frac{4}{3x - 3} = \\frac{2}{(x + 2)} - \\frac{4}{3(x - 1)}$\n\n$= \\frac{3 \\cdot 2(x - 1)}{3(x - 1)(x + 2)} - \\frac{4(x + 2)}{3(x - 1)(x + 2)} = \\frac{6(x - 1) - 4(x + 2)}{3(x - 1)(x + 2)}$\n\n$= \\frac{6x - 6 - 4x - 8}{3(x - 1)(x + 2)} = \\frac{2x - 14}{3(x - 1)(x + 2)} = \\frac{2x - 14}{3x^2 + 3x - 6}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\n- **Forkorting av rasjonale uttrykk:** Faktoriser både teljar og nevnar, deretter stryk like faktorar\n- **Multiplikasjon:** $\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{ac}{bd}$ - gang teljarar og gang nevnarar, forkort undervegs viss mogleg\n- **Divisjon:** $\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$ - snu den andre brøken og gang\n- **Addisjon/subtraksjon med lik nevnar:** Trekk saman teljarane, behald nevnaren\n- **Utviding:** Gang både teljar og nevnar med same faktor for å få ønskt nevnar\n- **Fellesnevnar:** Faktoriser nevnarane og finn minste felles multiplum, eller gang nevnarane med kvarandre\n- Vær forsiktig med fortegn når du trekkjer frå brøkar: $\\frac{a}{b} - \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{ad - bc}{bd}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgåver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgåver","content":[{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Forkort brøkane","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{6x}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2x"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{4x^2}{2x}$","expressionAnswer":"2x"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{10xy}{5y}$","expressionAnswer":"2x"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3x + 6}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"x+2"}],"solution":"a) $2x$, b) $2x$, c) $2x$, d) $\\frac{3(x+2)}{3} = x + 2$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Faktoriser teljar og nevnar, og stryk felles faktorar."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rekn ut og forkort","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x}{2} \\cdot \\frac{4}{x}$","answer":2},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{x} \\cdot \\frac{x^2}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"x/2"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{b}{a}$","answer":1},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2x}{3} \\cdot \\frac{9}{4x}$","expressionAnswer":"3/2"}],"solution":"a) $2$, b) $\\frac{x}{2}$, c) $1$, d) $\\frac{3}{2}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Gang teller med teller og nemnar med nemnar, og forkort undervegs."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Faktoriser og forkort","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x - 3}$","expressionAnswer":"x+3"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{x^2 + 5x}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"x+5"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2x + 4}{x + 2}$","answer":2},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{x^2 - x}{x^2}$","expressionAnswer":"(x-1)/x"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{(x+3)(x-3)}{x-3} = x + 3$, b) $\\frac{x(x+5)}{x} = x + 5$, c) $\\frac{2(x+2)}{x+2} = 2$, d) $\\frac{x(x-1)}{x^2} = \\frac{x-1}{x}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Faktoriser tellaren først. I a) kan du bruke konjugatsetningen."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Finn fellesnemnar og rekn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{x}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"x/2"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{x} + \\frac{3}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"5/x"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{2x}$","expressionAnswer":"3/(2x)"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{x + 1}{2} + \\frac{x - 1}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"x"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{2x}{6} + \\frac{x}{6} = \\frac{3x}{6} = \\frac{x}{2}$, b) $\\frac{5}{x}$, c) $\\frac{2}{2x} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3}{2x}$, d) $\\frac{2x}{2} = x$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Utvid brøkane slik at dei får same nemnar før du legg dei saman."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-ex-5","number":"R5","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Rekn ut og skriv så enkelt som mogleg","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{x + 1} + \\frac{3}{x - 1}$","expressionAnswer":"(5x+1)/(x^2-1)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{x}{x - 2} - \\frac{2}{x - 2}$","answer":1},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{1}{x} - \\frac{1}{x + 1}$","expressionAnswer":"1/(x*(x+1))"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{\\;\\frac{x}{2}\\;}{\\;\\frac{x}{4}\\;}$","answer":2}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{2(x-1) + 3(x+1)}{(x+1)(x-1)} = \\frac{5x + 1}{x^2 - 1}$, b) $\\frac{x - 2}{x - 2} = 1$, c) $\\frac{(x+1) - x}{x(x+1)} = \\frac{1}{x(x+1)}$, d) $\\frac{x}{2} \\cdot \\frac{4}{x} = 2$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Fellesnemнaren i a) er $(x+1)(x-1)$. I d) gangar du med den omvendte brøken."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}],"exercises":[],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"ec9d2d6feec9c0e5","translatedAt":"2026-06-16T10:00:12.536Z","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","strings":186,"tm":{"2fb457cb5786db8a":"Rasjonale uttrykk","c75c9c8f64841dca":"Lær å forkorte, multiplisere, dividere og trekke saman brøker med algebraiske uttrykk, samt løyse brøklikningar.","a93eea02f788abcb":"forenkle algebraiske brøkuttrykk","f39894a8ee82d3e5":"løyse likningar med brøker","22237a2a0c8827bc":"## Brøker med algebraiske uttrykk\n\n**Nødvendige forkunnskapar:** Algebra og faktorisering\n\nI dette kapitlet skal vi lære å rekne med brøker som inneheld algebraiske uttrykk (bokstavar). Vi skal sjå på korleis vi forkortar, multipliserer, dividerer og trekk saman slike brøker.","58916c7752f6e6c9":"Døme 1","a4debb8b89c9dd6b":"Forkort brøkene:\n\na) $\\frac{2x}{3x}$\n\nb) $\\frac{3x - 6}{6}$\n\nc) $\\frac{x^2 - 5x + 6}{x^2 - 4}$","06b393ceed0c8070":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{2x}{3x} = \\frac{2 \\cdot x}{3 \\cdot x} = \\frac{2}{3}$\n\nb) $\\frac{3x - 6}{6} = \\frac{3 \\cdot (x - 2)}{3 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{x - 2}{2}$\n\nc) $\\frac{x^2 - 5x + 6}{x^2 - 4} = \\frac{(x - 2)(x - 3)}{(x - 2)(x + 2)} = \\frac{x - 3}{x + 2}$","abeb0ff989943d7c":"Forkort brøkane","2a9666625a02e01f":"$\\frac{4x}{9x}$","d9b1a2e067bb5467":"$\\frac{4x}{9x} = \\frac{4 \\cdot x}{9 \\cdot x} = \\frac{4}{9}$","77dc246fd9f5cb70":"$\\frac{2x}{x^2 - 2x}$","ddb594c731445108":"$\\frac{2x}{x^2 - 2x} = \\frac{2 \\cdot x}{x \\cdot (x - 2)} = \\frac{2}{x - 2}$","9ad1affa8b414d03":"$\\frac{x^2 - 5x}{x - 5}$","06365bec475dd940":"$\\frac{x^2 - 5x}{x - 5} = \\frac{x \\cdot (x - 5)}{x - 5} = x$","ce9202260f29ef89":"$\\frac{2x - 8}{4}$","60218e3b855fad45":"$\\frac{2x - 8}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x - 4)}{2 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{x - 4}{2}$","74f88f79072934b5":"$\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x + 3}$","25786d66447a670c":"$\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x + 3} = \\frac{(x - 3) \\cdot (x + 3)}{x + 3} = x - 3$","9c29d42ddb630b3f":"$\\frac{x^2 - 7x + 12}{2x - 6}$","8b4f8dc06fc15b4e":"$\\frac{x^2 - 7x + 12}{2x - 6} = \\frac{(x - 3) \\cdot (x - 4)}{2 \\cdot (x - 3)} = \\frac{x - 4}{2}$","e67872a68d97d8c7":"a) $\\frac{4}{9}$, b) $\\frac{2}{x-2}$, c) $x$, d) $\\frac{x-4}{2}$, e) $x-3$, f) $\\frac{x-4}{2}$","d2c49ca04be2f5a6":"Faktoriser teller og nemnar før du forkortar","0dcdf90952edec99":"Døme 2","8a7ee5cf97cccb06":"Multipliser og forkort brøkene:\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3x} \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{4}$\n\nb) $\\frac{x}{2x + 8} \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{3x}$\n\nc) $3x^2 \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{3x^2 - 27}$","cc37a2fbfc09cd77":"**Løysing:**\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3x} \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x + 3)}{3x \\cdot 4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x + 3)}{3x \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{x + 3}{6x}$\n\nb) $\\frac{x}{2x + 8} \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{3x} = \\frac{x \\cdot (x + 4)}{(2x + 8) \\cdot 3x} = \\frac{x \\cdot (x + 4) \\cdot 1}{2(x + 4) \\cdot 3 \\cdot x} = \\frac{1}{6}$\n\nc) $3x^2 \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{3x^2 - 27} = \\frac{3x^2}{1} \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{3(x^2 - 9)} = \\frac{3 \\cdot x^2 \\cdot (x + 3)}{3 \\cdot (x + 3) \\cdot (x - 3)} = \\frac{x^2}{x - 3}$","8cd659802d3e5d4e":"Multipliser og forkort (om mogleg) brøkene","cffc999c1c04e151":"$\\frac{x + 5}{5x} \\cdot \\frac{5}{2x + 10}$","2cac090a10666cde":"$\\frac{x + 5}{5x} \\cdot \\frac{5}{2x + 10} = \\frac{(x + 5) \\cdot 5}{5x \\cdot 2(x + 5)} = \\frac{5 \\cdot (x + 5)}{5 \\cdot 2 \\cdot x \\cdot (x + 5)} = \\frac{1}{2x}$","d659ade87eeb2c09":"$\\frac{2x}{3x - 12} \\cdot \\frac{x^2 - 16}{4}$","c45bc61998641421":"$\\frac{2x}{3x - 12} \\cdot \\frac{x^2 - 16}{4} = \\frac{2x}{3(x-4)} \\cdot \\frac{(x-4)(x+4)}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot x \\cdot (x-4) \\cdot (x+4)}{3 \\cdot (x-4) \\cdot 4} = \\frac{x(x+4)}{6}$","0670af45f3425688":"$5x \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{4x^2 - 16x}$","07594d131ae98221":"$5x \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{4x^2 - 16x} = \\frac{5x}{1} \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{4x(x - 4)} = \\frac{5 \\cdot x \\cdot (x + 4)}{4 \\cdot x \\cdot (x - 4)} = \\frac{5(x + 4)}{4(x - 4)}$","1dd28dbde9383be9":"a) $\\frac{1}{2x}$, b) $\\frac{x(x+4)}{6}$, c) $\\frac{5(x+4)}{4(x-4)}$","49a32b31cdb9e21e":"Faktoriser først, deretter forkortar du like faktorar i teller og nemnar","0ef7674ff5b1e5bc":"$\\frac{x}{2} \\div \\frac{2x}{3}$","5867472498bf99e8":"$\\frac{x}{2} \\div \\frac{2x}{3} = \\frac{x}{2} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2x} = \\frac{x \\cdot 3}{2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot x} = \\frac{3}{4}$","3762d2d2330e9425":"$\\frac{x + 9}{2x} \\div \\frac{x^2 - 81}{2x + 8}$","405d04b223623abe":"$\\frac{x + 9}{2x} \\div \\frac{x^2 - 81}{2x + 8} = \\frac{x + 9}{2x} \\cdot \\frac{2x + 8}{(x-9)(x+9)} = \\frac{(x + 9) \\cdot 2(x + 4)}{2x \\cdot (x-9) \\cdot (x+9)} = \\frac{x + 4}{x(x - 9)}$","09cbbed096e1eb6b":"$4x \\div \\frac{x}{x^2 - 16}$","44c73f0c7a2e12b8":"$4x \\div \\frac{x}{x^2 - 16} = \\frac{4x}{1} \\cdot \\frac{x^2 - 16}{x} = \\frac{4 \\cdot x \\cdot (x-4)(x+4)}{x} = 4(x-4)(x+4)$","92a652aba1edcb25":"a) $\\frac{3}{4}$, b) $\\frac{x+4}{x(x-9)}$, c) $4(x-4)(x+4)$","86e3c4f1ca67f2e2":"Ved divisjon: snu den andre brøken og gang","24420a2392249d81":"Døme 3","a3b322bbfbfbe946":"Trekk saman brøkane:\n\n$\\frac{9x + 3y}{4x} - \\frac{x - 3y}{4x}$","4c4ecda7874dc8f2":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{9x + 3y}{4x} - \\frac{x - 3y}{4x} = \\frac{9x + 3y - (x - 3y)}{4x} = \\frac{9x + 3y - x + 3y}{4x}$\n\n$= \\frac{8x + 6y}{4x} = \\frac{2(4x + 3y)}{2 \\cdot 2x} = \\frac{4x + 3y}{2x}$","33922c26f8f3355d":"Trekk saman brøkane og forkort viss mogleg","68a19c590aecfe4b":"$\\frac{2x}{4} + \\frac{3x}{4}$","e3f07713e390dbd2":"$\\frac{2x}{4} + \\frac{3x}{4} = \\frac{2x + 3x}{4} = \\frac{5x}{4}$","8c98f30cd0a0fa2d":"$\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{8x}{3}$","1ccdd1204c0da929":"$\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{8x}{3} = \\frac{2x - 8x}{3} = \\frac{-6x}{3} = -2x$","a3779f504ca20503":"$\\frac{y}{5} - \\frac{3y}{5}$","d7476f64c0c2612b":"$\\frac{y}{5} - \\frac{3y}{5} = \\frac{y - 3y}{5} = \\frac{-2y}{5}$","f2e18e9478f3daf2":"$\\frac{2x - y}{4x} - \\frac{3x}{4x}$","3a4c6cf853bc64f5":"$\\frac{2x - y}{4x} - \\frac{3x}{4x} = \\frac{(2x - y) - 3x}{4x} = \\frac{2x - y - 3x}{4x} = \\frac{-x - y}{4x}$","4b42695ac93709ab":"$\\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{3 - 6x}{3}$","029ac8a228c16cb0":"$\\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{3 - 6x}{3} = \\frac{x + 2x - (3 - 6x)}{3} = \\frac{x + 2x - 3 + 6x}{3} = \\frac{9x - 3}{3} = \\frac{3(3x - 1)}{3} = 3x - 1$","435c0129ee2b16b8":"$\\frac{x + 6}{2x + 1} - \\frac{3x - 4}{2x + 1}$","22bfa1cb468a2088":"$\\frac{x + 6}{2x + 1} - \\frac{3x - 4}{2x + 1} = \\frac{(x + 6) - (3x - 4)}{2x + 1} = \\frac{x + 6 - 3x + 4}{2x + 1} = \\frac{-2x + 10}{2x + 1}$","3e75e1ce0300544e":"a) $\\frac{5x}{4}$, b) $-2x$, c) $\\frac{-2y}{5}$, d) $\\frac{-x-y}{4x}$, e) $3x-1$, f) $\\frac{-2x+10}{2x+1}$","67cb1eb47bdc001d":"Når nemnurane er like, trekkjer du saman teljarane","e3a92c2e9bd9134b":"Utviding av brøkar","b1f95be9c5e867d1":"For å trekk saman brøkar med **ulik nemnar** må vi først utvidle brøkane slik at dei får **lik nemnar** (fellesnemnar).\n\nVi utviklar ein brøk ved å gange teljar og nemnar med same faktor.","252546d9ba5d4c16":"Døme 4","0a51bea0993703dd":"Utvild brøken slik at du får $x^2 - 4$ i nemnar:\n\n$\\frac{3}{x - 2}$","fa5d91f338453faf":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{3}{x - 2} = \\frac{3(x + 2)}{(x - 2)(x + 2)} = \\frac{3x + 6}{x^2 - 4}$","e76fc6f688f8f6a9":"Utvild brøken","04ec8a9532f8cfc2":"$\\frac{9}{x - 2}$ slik at nemnaren blir $2x - 4$","296d54115e6b1ae0":"Vi ser at $2x - 4 = 2(x - 2)$, så vi må gange med 2: $\\frac{9}{x - 2} = \\frac{9 \\cdot 2}{(x - 2) \\cdot 2} = \\frac{18}{2x - 4}$","dfcc09f6047495dd":"$\\frac{5}{x + 3}$ slik at nemnaren blir $x^2 - 9$","da52522b8e2684d7":"Vi ser at $x^2 - 9 = (x + 3)(x - 3)$, så vi må gange med $(x - 3)$: $\\frac{5}{x + 3} = \\frac{5 \\cdot (x - 3)}{(x + 3) \\cdot (x - 3)} = \\frac{5x - 15}{x^2 - 9}$","4d7b76708aacb7bd":"$\\frac{3x}{x - 2}$ slik at nemnaren blir $2x^2 - 8$","2a035363b69064b7":"Vi ser at $2x^2 - 8 = 2(x^2 - 4) = 2(x - 2)(x + 2)$, så vi må gange med $2(x + 2)$: $\\frac{3x}{x - 2} = \\frac{3x \\cdot 2(x + 2)}{(x - 2) \\cdot 2(x + 2)} = \\frac{6x(x + 2)}{2x^2 - 8}$","7ed2f54deeb480fd":"a) $\\frac{18}{2x-4}$, b) $\\frac{5x-15}{x^2-9}$, c) $\\frac{6x(x+2)}{2x^2-8}$","89791102306da6ec":"Finn kva du må gange nemnaren med for å få ynskt nemnar, og gang teljaren med det same","1f132a17820f95bc":"Døme 5","53027fd5425b9de1":"Trekk saman brøkane:\n\n$\\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3}{2}$","b8ef5f6ea1f36197":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3 \\cdot y}{2 \\cdot y} = \\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3y}{2y} = \\frac{5x + 3y}{2y}$","fc5dbeba01923d16":"$\\frac{3}{2} + \\frac{1}{2x}$","2793e21a1d28d38d":"Fellesnevnar er $2x$: $\\frac{3}{2} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3 \\cdot x}{2 \\cdot x} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3x}{2x} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3x + 1}{2x}$","c753ead42853e2ed":"$\\frac{4x}{2} + \\frac{2x}{5}$","e1455cb792d1e5b6":"Fellesnevnar er $10$: $\\frac{4x}{2} + \\frac{2x}{5} = \\frac{4x \\cdot 5}{2 \\cdot 5} + \\frac{2x \\cdot 2}{5 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{20x}{10} + \\frac{4x}{10} = \\frac{24x}{10} = \\frac{12x}{5}$","a4fa40f9d07262f6":"$\\frac{2y}{5} - \\frac{x}{3}$","48bef63f958a3c00":"Fellesnevnar er $15$: $\\frac{2y}{5} - \\frac{x}{3} = \\frac{2y \\cdot 3}{5 \\cdot 3} - \\frac{x \\cdot 5}{3 \\cdot 5} = \\frac{6y}{15} - \\frac{5x}{15} = \\frac{6y - 5x}{15}$","286746d63bf4b3b3":"$\\frac{3x}{2y} + \\frac{2y}{x}$","4dc1349d0225cc17":"Fellesnevnar er $2xy$: $\\frac{3x}{2y} + \\frac{2y}{x} = \\frac{3x \\cdot x}{2y \\cdot x} + \\frac{2y \\cdot 2y}{x \\cdot 2y} = \\frac{3x^2}{2xy} + \\frac{4y^2}{2xy} = \\frac{3x^2 + 4y^2}{2xy}$","44779c6deadd0b87":"$\\frac{x}{5} - 3x$","1634297857f85fdd":"Skriv $3x$ som brøk med nevnar $5$: $\\frac{x}{5} - 3x = \\frac{x}{5} - \\frac{3x \\cdot 5}{5} = \\frac{x}{5} - \\frac{15x}{5} = \\frac{x - 15x}{5} = \\frac{-14x}{5}$","951fa7e8eec8b489":"$\\frac{2x}{11y} - \\frac{4x}{11} - 2$","d62dc6c15bf6ee1b":"Fellesnevnar er $11y$: $\\frac{2x}{11y} - \\frac{4x \\cdot y}{11 \\cdot y} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 11y}{11y} = \\frac{2x}{11y} - \\frac{4xy}{11y} - \\frac{22y}{11y} = \\frac{2x - 4xy - 22y}{11y}$","f0d5ef97b2f1d3a5":"a) $\\frac{3x+1}{2x}$, b) $\\frac{12x}{5}$, c) $\\frac{6y-5x}{15}$, d) $\\frac{3x^2+4y^2}{2xy}$, e) $\\frac{-14x}{5}$, f) $\\frac{2x-4xy-22y}{11y}$","1f1e5043d1f35e74":"Finn fellesnevnar og utvid kvar brøk","2d6f571d751362c1":"Døme 6","e9811157d542aa62":"Trekk saman brøkane:\n\n$\\frac{4}{3xy} + \\frac{3x}{2y} - 2$","18994125eac9fba9":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{4}{3xy} + \\frac{3x}{2y} - \\frac{2}{1} = \\frac{4 \\cdot 2}{3xy \\cdot 2} + \\frac{3x \\cdot 3x}{2y \\cdot 3x} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 6xy}{1 \\cdot 6xy} = \\frac{8}{6xy} + \\frac{9x^2}{6xy} - \\frac{12xy}{6xy}$\n\n$= \\frac{8 + 9x^2 - 12xy}{6xy} = \\frac{9x^2 - 12xy + 8}{6xy}$","9ecbc8453221417d":"$\\frac{3}{2xy} + \\frac{1}{3x} - 1$","331300000ca52933":"Fellesnevnar er $6xy$: $\\frac{3}{2xy} + \\frac{1}{3x} - 1 = \\frac{3 \\cdot 3}{2xy \\cdot 3} + \\frac{1 \\cdot 2y}{3x \\cdot 2y} - \\frac{1 \\cdot 6xy}{6xy} = \\frac{9}{6xy} + \\frac{2y}{6xy} - \\frac{6xy}{6xy} = \\frac{9 + 2y - 6xy}{6xy}$","2615e3c20dee036d":"$\\frac{3}{2ab} + \\frac{1}{5}$","3aa924ca1285f498":"Fellesnevnar er $10ab$: $\\frac{3}{2ab} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 5}{2ab \\cdot 5} + \\frac{1 \\cdot 2ab}{5 \\cdot 2ab} = \\frac{15}{10ab} + \\frac{2ab}{10ab} = \\frac{15 + 2ab}{10ab}$","2b5865a7ed51514f":"$\\frac{2}{5x} - \\frac{1}{3y} - 1$","88ea6cce0f30e075":"Fellesnevnar er $15xy$: $\\frac{2}{5x} - \\frac{1}{3y} - 1 = \\frac{2 \\cdot 3y}{5x \\cdot 3y} - \\frac{1 \\cdot 5x}{3y \\cdot 5x} - \\frac{15xy}{15xy} = \\frac{6y}{15xy} - \\frac{5x}{15xy} - \\frac{15xy}{15xy} = \\frac{6y - 5x - 15xy}{15xy}$","3f3180199a9c1997":"a) $\\frac{9+2y-6xy}{6xy}$, b) $\\frac{15+2ab}{10ab}$, c) $\\frac{6y-5x-15xy}{15xy}$","7ae0883e6f4ed4fa":"Finn fellesnevnar for alle ledda","77f5e20a312747a9":"Døme 7","9a8c355077b68194":"Trekk saman:\n\n$\\frac{4}{x + 2} - 2$","cc2229ac2e6402c4":"**Løysing:**\n\n$\\frac{4}{x + 2} - \\frac{2}{1} = \\frac{4}{x + 2} - \\frac{2(x + 2)}{1(x + 2)} = \\frac{4}{x + 2} - \\frac{2x + 4}{x + 2} = \\frac{4 - (2x + 4)}{x + 2}$\n\n$= \\frac{4 - 2x - 4}{x + 2} = \\frac{-2x}{x + 2}$","314f77314a7c22c8":"$\\frac{5}{x + 2} + \\frac{1}{3}$","914c1dd6c42255cd":"Fellesnevnar er $3(x + 2)$: $\\frac{5}{x + 2} + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{5 \\cdot 3}{(x + 2) \\cdot 3} + \\frac{1 \\cdot (x + 2)}{3 \\cdot (x + 2)} = \\frac{15}{3(x + 2)} + \\frac{x + 2}{3(x + 2)} = \\frac{15 + x + 2}{3(x + 2)} = \\frac{x + 17}{3(x + 2)}$","d62b66e6dd41ea7a":"$\\frac{2}{x + 3} - \\frac{1}{2}$","80e5214b3a3ff4bf":"Fellesnevnar er $2(x + 3)$: $\\frac{2}{x + 3} - \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 2}{(x + 3) \\cdot 2} - \\frac{1 \\cdot (x + 3)}{2 \\cdot (x + 3)} = \\frac{4}{2(x + 3)} - \\frac{x + 3}{2(x + 3)} = \\frac{4 - (x + 3)}{2(x + 3)} = \\frac{1 - x}{2(x + 3)}$","227746a28f8454da":"$2 - \\frac{x + 2}{3}$","440820f634225fae":"Skriv 2 som brøk: $2 - \\frac{x + 2}{3} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 3}{3} - \\frac{x + 2}{3} = \\frac{6}{3} - \\frac{x + 2}{3} = \\frac{6 - (x + 2)}{3} = \\frac{6 - x - 2}{3} = \\frac{4 - x}{3}$","929917a8b94975bd":"$\\frac{3}{y + 1} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)}$","9a6c04a828aaf743":"Fellesnevnar er $2(y + 1)$: $\\frac{3}{y + 1} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 2}{(y + 1) \\cdot 2} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)} = \\frac{6}{2(y + 1)} 